# Shelve this directory out of the build and test walk.
#
# It holds sample `.zone.tree` manifests that the end to end harness
# copies into a temporary project. They are FIXTURES, not zone package
# source, so `term make` must not compile them and `term test` must not
# run them.
#
# The marker shelves this directory and everything under it, and nothing
# else. `test/base.tree` beside it is real and stays in the walk. See
# the draft marker rules in `deck/term/CLAUDE.md`.

note draft
